The customer paid 1.90 more than half the original. So the customer paid 0.5original - 1.90. The 20 off coupon was 20. The 22% off was a amount. The total he paid was the 22% off amount - 20. 0.5original - 1.90 = the 22% off amount - 20. The 22% off amount is 0.5original - 7.10. 0.5original = 0.5original - 7.10 + 20. 0.5original = 12.90. The original is 25.90. The 25.90 was 100 - 22 = 78% of the original price. The  original is 25.90 / 0.78 = 33. The answer is (C) 33.40.  I will not chosse.  I will chose (C) 33.40.  I was wron g.  I will chose (C) 8877 (C) 33.  3
Therefore, among A through E, the answer is \textbf{C}

Find out which of the following values is the multiple of X, if it is divisible by 9 and 12? Answer Choices: (A) 36 (B) 15 (C) 17 (D) 5 (E) 7
If it is divisible by both 9 and 12, it is divisible by the least common multiple of 9 and 12, which is 36. So, the answer is (A) 36.
