Hose A can fill the pool in 8 hours, so in 2 hours it can fill 2/8 = 1/4 of the pool. Then in the next 3 hours, 1/4 of the pool and hose B can fill the rest of the pool, so 3/8 of the pool was from hose B. The 3 is 3 out of a fraction, so the fraction is 3/1. 1/4 is to 1 as 3 is to 4, so 4 is the answer. 4 * 2 is 8. The 8 is from hose A.  The 4 is from  B. 4 is the answer. 4 is (A).  The  answer is  A.
