\frac{2}{3}x - 10 &= \frac{1}{3}x + 40 \\
\frac{2}{3}x - \frac{1}{3}x &= 40 + 10 \\
\frac{1}{3}x &= 50 \\
x &= 150
\end{align*}
So, the answer is (C) 150.
